From u4503d879f0dbaa93 at groups.google.com  Mon Aug 14 14:33:54 2017
From: u4503d879f0dbaa93 at groups.google.com (Vy T. Nguyen)
Date: Mon, 14 Aug 2017 14:33:54 +0000
Subject: Nmixture model with a categorical site covariate
Message-ID: <wUAa02bi8dY.vvnanK2nCgAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/unmarked/c/wUAa02bi8dY/m/vvnanK2nCgAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

